\begin_inset Formula $f_{cut}\approx1.061\times10^{5}Hz$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

\end_deeper
\begin_layout Enumerate
Because the capacitor going to ground slowly discharges, the carrier wave
 signal is filtered out from the rectified output signal.
\end_layout

\end_deeper
